---
:backtrace: true
:verbose: true
:concurrent_downloads: 8
gem: "--no-document --color"
# gem CLI through the gemstash Platform Service (bundler already mirrors via
# ~/.config/bundle/config). rubygems.org second: RubyGems warns and falls
# through when a source is down, so a stopped gemstash (or a fresh machine
# where ~/.default-gems is installing gemstash itself) degrades instead of
# deadlocking. See gemstash-ctl(8).
:sources:
- http://127.0.0.1:9292
- https://rubygems.org
